      "type": "slider",
      "label": "Outfield wall distance (ft)",
      "range": [
        100,
        600,
        10
      ],
      "default": 400,
      "teaches": "Clearing the wall is a comparison of two heights at a single x-value; move the wall far enough out and the same hit becomes an out."
    },
    {
